  "limits": [
    "Eight cells, one completed trial each. Native rows used same-path/profile build replacement after natural access expiry; bridge rows used explicit-pin or local-latest launch selection without that expiry wait. Official installers and built-in updaters were not measured.",
    "Controller replay with required client credentials is separate from native refresh. Four native cells reused prior refresh; four bridge cells requested new authorization before consent.",
    "After-store snapshots follow at least 60 s observation and controller replay, not the immediate first connection. VS Code ciphertext was not decrypted.",
    "Access-token TTL was 120 s and refresh-token TTL 24 h, with rotation disabled. Traffic frequency was not diagnosed and is not a product norm."
